
## 3. Create `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual environment
venv/
.env/

# Large files (optional - exclude if you want to keep CSV in repo)
# *.csv
# *.xlsx

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Log files
*.log